<section id="bbs014" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>A horizontal timeline of dated milestones under a working title, each a date-led label and one sentence; the minimal variant carries the sequence as one line with evenly spaced nodes.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="YDX1RL-Gt9"><h2>The next two quarters, month by month</h2><smart-layout cell-size="20" orientation="horizontal" variant="minimalTimeline"><smart-layout-item><h4>April · Accounts listed</h4><p>Regional managers confirm the standing-schedule list. Owner: Sales Operations.</p></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><h4>May · Routes fixed</h4><p>Delivery days agreed and stock reserved on the top twenty items. Owner: Operations.</p></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><h4>July · New lines relaunched</h4><p>Training material and pricing ship to the sales team. Owner: Product Marketing.</p></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><h4>September · Review</h4><p>Results against plan and the decision on a third warehouse shift. Owner: Finance.</p></smart-layout-item></smart-layout></grid-item></grid></section>